# SECURITY: real client-confidential contract PDFs. These must never be
# committed to a public repository. This .gitignore entry only stops
# FUTURE commits -- the six PDFs already committed are still readable in
# git history and must be purged separately (git filter-repo / BFG),
# then force-pushed, with collaborators re-cloning afterward. See the
# remediation notes in the audit / README for the exact commands.
source_pdfs/